 "notes": [
  "Massive (classic). Modulation routings (drag-and-drop), LFO shapes, stepper steps and performer curves are not exposed to the host: start from a preset that holds the routings (live_plugin_expose preset_file=) and drive them through the sources' levels (ENVELOPEn-*.LEV, MODn-AMP) and the macros.",
  "ENVELOPE4 is the amp envelope. MOD5..MOD8 are the LFO / performer / stepper slots (what each is depends on the patch).",
  "SD.LN/SD.LD/SD.RN/SD.RD on a master effect: its sync delay's left/right numerator and denominator."
 ],
